<title>USA: Allen Parish SD Ward One, La. won by Hibernia. [CORRECTED 19:54 GMT]</title>
<headline>Allen Parish SD Ward One, La. won by Hibernia. [CORRECTED 19:54 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
